Quality Control approval.</TAI><TAI OPT="ARMY"> for information only.  When used, a code following the "G" classification identifies the office that will review the 
submittal for the Government.</TAI>  Submit the following in accordance with Section <SRF>01 33 00</SRF> SUBMITTAL PROCEDURES:</TXT><BRK/>
