<NPR>NOTE:  Do not use less than<MET> 1.02 mm</MET><ENG> 20-gauge</ENG> material in humid locations or project locations with Environmental 
Severity Classifications (ESC) of C3 thru C5.  Humid locations are those in ASHRAE climate zones 0A, 1A, 2A, 3A, 
