<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide insulation, facer material and attachment compatible with metal roof system specified, as approved by the roof panel manufacturer, and 
meeting all the requirements as specified in Section <SRF>07 22 00</SRF> ROOF AND DECK INSULATION.</TXT><BRK/>
