metal roofing.  Use membrane resistant to cyclical elevated temperatures for extended period of time in high heat service conditions.  Provide 
membrane with integral non-tacking top surface of polyethylene film or other surface material to serve as separator between bituminous material 
and metal products to be applied above.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL>Slip Sheet</TTL><BRK/>
